blocks.en:
Our contributions are summarized as follows: 1) We introduce DiVid , a dimension-level diagnostic framework that decomposes video diversity into six interpretable dimensions and provides localized analysis of diversity collapse;
2) We systematically evaluate representative video generation models and reveal that diversity is highly dimension-specific, with substantial gaps hidden by existing global metrics;
3) Through controlled intervention studies, we identify two fundamental diversity bottlenecks, default mode convergence and realization gaps, providing actionable directions for data curation, training objectives, and generation strategies.

blocks.zh:
我们的贡献概述如下: 1) 我们引入了DiVid,一个维度级诊断框架,将视频多样性分解为六个可解释的维度,并对多样性崩溃进行局部分析;
(2) 我们系统地评价有代表性的视频生成模型,并揭示多样性具有高度的特异性,现有全球衡量标准掩盖了巨大的差距;
3) 通过有控制的干预研究,我们找出两个基本的多样化瓶颈,默认模式的趋同和实现差距,为数据整理,培训目标和生成战略提供可操作的方向.

blocks.en:
Our extraction accordingly follows the background-compensation paradigm validated in action recognition [ 63 ] , adapted to set-level measurement: we exclude the foreground with a dilated mask and fit a global partial-affine transform (translation, rotation, uniform scale) by RANSAC, which is richer than subtracting an averaged background vector from an averaged foreground vector [ 53 ] ; Motion adds a canonicalized deformation channel with two interpretable kernels for relative displacement and internal deformation; Camera aggregates translation, scale, and rotation into a 16-D descriptor;
All key parameters are carefully selected by pilot analyses to reflect its intended factor and are then fixed across all models and prompts.
The pipeline makes dimension-resolved diversity measurement efficient at benchmark scale. As motion and camera estimation for generated video improves in reliability and efficiency, we can update the corresponding modules.

blocks.zh:
因此,我们的提取遵循在行动识别[63]中验证的背景补偿范式,适应了设定水平的测量:我们排除了带有放大罩的前地,并适应了RANSAC的全球部分亚麻变换(翻译、旋转、统一比例),它比从平均前地矢量中减去平均背景矢量[53]更为丰富; 运动增加了一个可解释的变形通道,其中包含两个内核,用于相对迁移和内部变形; 相机综合翻译、比例和旋转为16-D描述符; 模拟器;
所有关键参数都经过试点分析仔细选择,以反映其预期因素,然后在所有模型和提示中固定。
管道使解决的维度多样性计量在基准规模上具有效率。 随着对生成的视频的动作和相机估计在可靠性和效率上的提高,我们可以更新相应的模块.
